  "notes": "Chrome 153 marks the start of the stepped deprecation and removal rollout of Related Website Sets (RWS), formerly First-Party Sets. SAA calls across intra-set domains fall back to the standard permission prompt flow, requestStorageAccessFor is deprecated separately, and enterprise/extension policies are deprecated in parallel."
